# Public keys every Windows peer authorizes for the fleet tooling. Public
# halves only -- nothing here is secret. hosts/windows/enable-ssh.ps1 merges
# these into C:\ProgramData\ssh\administrators_authorized_keys, which is the
# ONLY file sshd consults for an Administrator account on Windows.
#
# Put your deploy runner's public key here, one per line, e.g.:
# ssh-ed25519 AAAA... fleet-deploy@ci-runner
